{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e1c9a2-4f3d-4c8e-9a1b-stepcaapi001",
    "name": "step-ca API",
    "description": "Koleksi endpoint HTTP step-ca (smallstep).\n\nSetup awal:\n1. CA default jalan di `https://localhost:9000` (docker-compose example ini).\n2. Karena sertifikat server CA biasanya self-signed: matikan **SSL certificate verification** di Postman (Settings > General) atau per-request.\n3. Untuk endpoint yang butuh **mTLS** (`/renew`, `/rekey`, `/ssh/renew`, `/ssh/rekey`): daftarkan client certificate di Postman (Settings > Certificates > Add client certificate) untuk host `localhost:9000`.\n4. Token (OTT) dibuat pakai step CLI, contoh:\n   `step ca token myserver.local --provisioner admin --ca-url https://localhost:9000 --root ./data/step/certs/root_ca.crt`\n   Untuk admin API: `step ca admin token ...` / gunakan provisioner admin.\n5. CSR contoh:\n   `step certificate create myserver.local server.csr server.key --csr --no-password --insecure`\n\nACME (`/acme/...`) sengaja tidak dimasukkan karena protokolnya butuh client ACME (certbot, step CLI, dsb), tidak praktis via Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "step-ca-local"
  },
