    {
      "name": "X.509 Certificates",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign (issue certificate)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"csr\": \"{{csr}}\",\n  \"ott\": \"{{ott}}\",\n  \"notBefore\": \"\",\n  \"notAfter\": \"\",\n  \"templateData\": {}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sign",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sign"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Issue certificate dari CSR + one-time token (OTT).\n\nBuat token:\n`step ca token myserver.local --provisioner admin --ca-url https://localhost:9000 --root ./data/step/certs/root_ca.crt`\n\nBuat CSR:\n`step certificate create myserver.local server.csr server.key --csr --no-password --insecure`\n\nCatatan: `notBefore`/`notAfter` kosongkan untuk pakai default provisioner. Bisa RFC3339 atau duration (mis. `24h`)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Renew (mTLS)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/renew",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "renew"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Renew certificate. **Wajib mTLS** (client certificate yang masih valid, belum expired). Tanpa body. Daftarkan client cert di Postman Settings > Certificates untuk host `localhost:9000`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Rekey (mTLS)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
