          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"serial\": \"{{serial}}\",\n  \"ott\": \"{{ott}}\",\n  \"reasonCode\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"superseded\",\n  \"passive\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/revoke",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "revoke"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revoke certificate by serial.\n- `passive` harus `true` (revocation aktif/CRL-based belum diimplementasi).\n- `reasonCode`: 0=unspecified, 1=keyCompromise, 3=affiliationChanged, 4=superseded, 5=cessationOfOperation, 9=privilegeWithdrawn, 10=AACompromise.\n- Bisa pakai OTT **atau** mTLS client cert.\n\nAmbil serial: `step certificate inspect server.crt --format json | jq .serial_number`\n\nBuat token revoke:\n`step ca token --revoke --serial <serial> --provisioner admin --ca-url ... --root ...`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
