    {
      "name": "Admin API",
      "description": "Admin API step-ca (teruji jalan di setup ini).\n\n⚠️ QUIRK KRUSIAL: middleware auth step-ca v0.30.2 TIDAK melakukan strip pada prefix 'Bearer '.\nHeader Authorization harus diisi token MURNI — TANPA 'Bearer '!\nJika pakai 'Bearer <token>', go-jose menghapus spasi lalu mendekode 'BearereyJ...' sebagai base64\n→ error 'invalid character \\x05' / 'illegal base64 data' yang sangat membingungkan.\n\nToken yang benar = X5C JWT (bukan OTT):\n- header: {alg:ES256, kid:<thumbprint RFC7638 pub-key>, typ:JWT, x5c:[leaf, intermediate]}\n- claims: {aud: <caURL><path>, iss: 'step-admin-client/1.0', sub: 'step', iat, exp, jti}\n- di-sign dengan private key cert super admin (subject 'step')\n\nCara mint cepat via CLI di container:\ndocker exec step-ca step crypto jwt sign --x5c-cert /tmp/admin.crt --x5c-key /tmp/admin.key \\\n  --iss step-admin-client/1.0 --sub step --aud 'https://localhost:9000/admin/provisioners' \\\n  --exp $(( $(date +%s) + 300 ))\n\nLalu: curl -H \"Authorization: $TOKEN\" (tanpa Bearer!) https://localhost:9000/admin/provisioners\n\nReferensi bug: https://github.com/smallstep/cli/issues/860",
      "item": [
